{'symbol': 'CTRA', 'date': '2019-11-13 22:30:00', 'title': 'CONTURA ENERGY, INC. REVISES OPERATIONAL GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL YEAR 2019 AND 2020; REPORTS ASSET IMPAIRMENT FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2019', 'text': 'CONTURA ENERGY, INC. REVISED OPERATIONAL GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL YEAR 2019 AND 2020. FOR THE FISCAL YEAR 2019, THE COMPANY EXPECTS TOTAL SHIPMENTS TO BE IN THE RANGE OF 23.2 MILLION TONS TO 24.6 MILLION TONS FROM THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED RANGE OF 23.9 MILLION TO 25.6 MILLION TONS.FOR THE FISCAL YEAR 2020, THE COMPANY EXPECTS TOTAL SHIPMENTS TO BE IN THE RANGE OF 22.1 MILLION TONS TO 24.1 MILLION TONS.THE COMPANY REPORTED ASSET IMPAIRMENT OF $32,000 FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2019.'}